sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Warp SQL server
  C->>S: POST …/statements, Prefer: respond-async
  S-->>C: 201 statement_id (running)
  C->>S: POST …/statements/{statement_id}/cancel
  S-->>C: 202 (a finished statement: still 202, nothing changes)
  C->>S: GET …/statements/{statement_id}
  S-->>C: 200 cancelled, cancel_reason "client", error statement_cancelled
  C->>S: POST /warp/v1/sessions/{id}/cancel
  S-->>C: 202 {"cancelled": [every statement queued or running]}
  C->>S: DELETE …/statements/{statement_id}
  S-->>C: 204 (result freed, id forgotten)
